[sofnt:comparatorFeatureList] > sofnt:listBase
 + * (sofnt:comparatorFeature) = sofnt:comparatorFeature

[sofnt:comparatorCard] > jnt:content, mix:title, sofmix:component, sofmix:cta orderable
 - description (string, textarea) mandatory i18n
 - image (weakreference, picker[type='image']) mandatory < jmix:image
 - badgeLabel (string) i18n
 + features (sofnt:comparatorFeatureList) = sofnt:comparatorFeatureList autocreated mandatory
